WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.070
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:13.660
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:16.210
Mountains are calling

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.170
The sky is calling

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:27.680
Something awaits you in the distance

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:34.060
So brightly     the blood burns

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:42.190
You understand why you were born

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:44.530
Run and Run!

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.490
Run and Run!

00:00:46.490 --> 00:00:50.070
Become the wind, and run

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:56.790
Go on, you're going to surpass the yesterdays you

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:04.590
You will stand up to yourself     to greater things

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:07.800
That's right!     It is young

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:14.810
It doesn't burn out     A shooting star

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:27.660
<i>Silver has left Ben in Moss'
care and left for Shikoku.</i>

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:38.550
<i>They got two new companions, The
Fighting Dog Musashi and The Bandit Bill.</i>

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:45.900
<i>Silver was also told that there
was a strong male in Uwajima.</i>

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:55.760
BENIZAKURA<i>!</i>
THE STRONGEST MALE IN THE WORLD

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:17.600
That is Uwajima.

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:21.980
Then, Mr Musashi. Let's talk about it.!

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:24.480
About that male who is stronger than you.

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:25.740
What did you say again?

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:26.740
Benizakura!

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:28.990
Right, Musashi?

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:35.830
I heard the name when I was in the circus.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:38.790
He's supposed to be incredible.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:45.010
The strongest male in the world.

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.300
Strongest in the world?

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:55.310
Benizakura was born more than ten
years ago in the snowy mountains.

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:02.320
He had neither good bloodline
nor a good upbringing.

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:09.820
He stands out from the crowd.

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:13.450
At the age of 3, He defeated all of
the large dogs in the Tohoku area.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:20.290
And then...
Without knowing defeat.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:25.040
At last, he got to the
National Grand Championships.

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:30.380
His opponent in Shikoku was
National Grand Champion, Tsunarashi.

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:34.130
The champion has defended his title six times-

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:37.880
-and has been given the title
of "Best Dog in Dog Fighting".

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:41.350
An eight-year old veteran.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:18.640
They are still talking about their match
in the world of Fighting Dogs.

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:19.930
It was really something to see.

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:42.240
None of them dropped an inch.
People cheered.

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:48.590
The time limit of 30 minutes expired
without the match being settled.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:51.060
Tsunarashi managed to get away.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:58.560
Benizakura was not happy.
He had lost both ears in the fight.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:07.760
He and his master gave
everything they had for a rematch.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:15.440
But the champion was old, 8 years.
He never accepted a rematch.

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:21.030
The following year, Tsunarashi lost his
eyesight and retired from Dog Fighting.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:23.570
What did Benizakura do then?

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:28.530
He knew nothing, he only thought
of a rematch with Tsunarashi.

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:38.110
He trained and trained, and
waited for an opportunity.

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:51.000
With both his ears lost, Benizakura got the
name "Sea Monster", and was feared.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:54.500
Two years later...

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:04.190
Benizakura was six years old.
He was absolutely unbeatable.

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:10.600
But he was waiting for
Tsunarashi which never came.

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:14.020
And one day... he couldn't wait
anymore and Benizakura....

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:20.660
He ran away?

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:21.910
Yes.

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:29.160
He swam over the sea like you did.
All alone, towards Tsunarashi.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.550
What a fighting spirit!

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.000
Unbelievable!

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:41.260
But when he finally found
Tsunarashi he got a shock.

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:46.520
He saw his own future.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:52.520
The blind Tsunarashi had become
a punching bag for young Fighting Dogs.

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:54.320
Benizakura got furious!

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:09.580
No one has seen him since.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:15.590
And the male is said to be
here in Uwajima, Musashi?

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:19.020
According to the rumors...

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:21.840
The strongest male on earth.

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:23.840
I want to see him!

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:27.350
<i>Meanwhile...</i>

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:33.350
<i>Ben's group was in trouble.</i>

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:37.320
Silver!

00:08:57.900 --> 00:09:00.460
<i>Cross wanted Silver to hurry up.</i>

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:03.710
<i>She challenged the raging waves to tell Silver.</i>

00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:14.270
Wilson, what's that?

00:09:14.310 --> 00:09:16.560
Uwajima's famous Fighting Bulls.

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:17.660
Fighting Bull?

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:21.310
A fight between bulls.
Has nothing to do with us.

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:24.160
Hey, Don!

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:25.330
Take him down!

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:28.580
Wilson is that?

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:29.580
Yeah.

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:40.230
You did it, Don!

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:44.180
Shin!

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:45.680
Take care of the Sea Monster!

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:47.740
Oh yeah!

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:51.560
What a strength for such an old dog!

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:54.810
I agree! That bull was not small.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:56.820
Silver, what you gonna do?

00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:59.320
How should we approach him?

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:00.670
It's already decided.

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:04.070
We have no choice but to greet
each other in our own way!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:04.820
Wh-What?

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:11.080
Excuse my impatience, Benizakura!

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.460
Who are you?

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:13.960
How do you know my name?

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:33.060
What are you doing?
Give back the collar!

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:42.940
Kid, was that your greeting?
Then I'll greet you back!

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:53.880
Silver!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.710
<i>He smiled!</i>

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:10.600
He recieved it!

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:12.850
Silver took a blow
from Benizakura and...

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:15.250
With that little body,
he actually withstood it!

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:17.060
Well done, Sea Monster!

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:23.940
Benizakura...

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:29.780
My greeting was just 1 blow.
You hit me twice.

00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:32.030
You owe me 1 blow!

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:32.770
What?

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:35.290
I'll give it back to you!
That blow.

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:36.310
Okay?

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:39.880
Wow!

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.300
You surprised me!

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:46.800
The fight has just begun!

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:55.050
What, Silver?!

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:57.940
You going alone again?

00:11:58.250 --> 00:11:59.440
You're kidding!

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:00.690
Listen up, Silver!

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:04.440
Even if you're the temporary
leader of the Platoon!

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:07.690
You let that bastard hit you twice!

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.940
Right... I can't forgive this!

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:11.620
This time, I'll go and beat him!

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:15.370
I don't know if he's the strongest,
but he can't handle all of us!

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.960
Wait!
Take it easy everyone!

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:21.990
Silver! You are too young.

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:25.780
We can't let anyone
make fun of the pack!

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:27.340
Wait, you!

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:29.590
What is it, Akame?

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:33.590
Should you really say something
like Silver is too young?

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:34.320
Nah...

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:35.550
No, we didn't mean...

00:12:35.590 --> 00:12:36.300
Right...

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:39.090
It's okay, Akatora, Kurotora.

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:44.470
But... this Benizakura.
We really need him.

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:49.990
But we can't take him by force.
No matter how many we are.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:57.240
I think exactly like Silver. The more we
are, the more resistance he does.

00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:58.990
What're you gonna do, Silver?

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:03.610
The reason I let him hit me 2 times-

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:08.250
- was to wait for a chance
to make contact with him.

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:09.100
I see!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:09.650
I see!
I see!

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:09.850
I see!

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.380
Well, be more like Silver?

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:15.130
Think about it and take action.

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:17.130
What the hell!

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:20.060
Common, don't get too hotheaded!

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:22.440
Booh!!!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:35.060
Oh, good there Lady!
You all right?

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:37.080
W-Where am I?

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:40.330
W-Who are you?

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:41.830
What is this?

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:47.970
Don't worry, my master likes you.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:49.680
There's nothing to worry about.

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:51.090
I didn't hear that!

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:52.720
Where is this?

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:56.320
Apparently, he wanted to save you.

00:13:56.470 --> 00:14:00.920
You mumbled in your sleep,
Here on Shikoku.

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:02.600
What did you say?
Shikoku?

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:05.100
Alright, I made it!

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:12.610
You saved my life.
I thank you.

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:17.860
So that's what happened.
But could you remove my chains?

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:21.870
What are you so upset about, Lady?

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:24.960
Why don't you tell me?

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:29.960
As you can see, I'm a bit old.
But I could be useful.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:37.220
<i>Cross thought the old dog felt like a grand male.</i>

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:40.970
<i>She bagan to feel the tension fade away.</i>

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:42.640
What did you say?!

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:45.140
Northern Platoon... Eliminated?!

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:49.060
Kurobe!

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:54.360
Four and five, wiped out by enemies.

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:59.100
I wanted to tell... Ben's group...

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.160
Kurobe!

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:06.150
Ben, go back to your
master and fix your eyes.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:08.910
We head north for the time being.

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:09.770
But...

00:15:09.770 --> 00:15:12.410
Ben, I know how hard it is.

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:15.960
The final battle with
Akakabuto is still ahead.

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:20.890
The most important thing is
that you get your vision back.

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:22.520
Thanks, Moss.

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:24.650
Let's go!

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:28.430
We have to protect the northern
line until Silver comes back!

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:29.770
Yes!

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:31.770
Moss! Wait!

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:36.510
Cross, you take Ben home to his owner.

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:40.910
Well of course...
Where do I meet up with you later?

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:45.910
Cross, even if you try,
you can't hide it from me.

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:50.020
You need to get away from
the pack a little.

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:53.490
Think of the puppies in your belly.

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:54.920
M-Moss...

00:15:57.670 --> 00:16:00.920
<i>Cross told Benizakura everything.</i>

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:05.930
<i>And she told that she had
to hurry and announce Silver.</i>

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:10.940
Well, what a great story.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:16.730
I think I know where
the tiger striped kid is.

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.740
Silver is?
Are you sure?

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:22.990
There's no mistake.

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:27.050
Like when I was young,
he's so impatient.

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:28.870
Benizakura!

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:31.220
So Silver is here?

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:36.620
I do not know if he is afraid.
He's gonna fight me.

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:38.130
Please don't do this!

00:16:38.170 --> 00:16:39.920
Don't touch that child!

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:44.150
Even if he's a child, he is a
warrior representing his pack!

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:47.390
It's just plain courtesy, that I
let him die like a real male.

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:50.400
Then, Benizakura!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.870
I've come to claim your debt!

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:54.150
Run away!

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:56.350
He's not an ordinary male!

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:58.440
Cross! What are you doing here?

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:02.320
We'll talk later! Hurry and run away!

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:04.660
I've been waiting, kid!

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:08.920
Brave of you to come alone!

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:10.090
Where's your pack?

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:13.040
Benizakura! It's only me you owe.

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:14.990
Please, be my comrade!

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.290
I heard the situation from Cross.

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:20.350
And how are you going to convince me?

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:22.590
If I have no choice but
to fight, I will do it!

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:26.350
Idiot! Do you know who that is?

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:27.850
Of course I do.

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:30.600
That's why we need him!

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:35.280
However Benizakura,
I have one request.

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:40.070
If... if I die here,

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:43.200
I'd like to ask you to
take over after me!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.990
I promise you.

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:48.240
I'll see how real your resolve is!

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:52.910
Stop it!

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:55.670
Silver!

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:02.300
Silver!

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:09.850
Oh, Silver.

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:13.870
Stop it!

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:17.650
I beg you... So you're willing to die
here without doing anything?!

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:18.850
Stand up, kid!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:24.330
You put a pregnant bitch on the battlefield,
and have the stomach to call yourself a male?

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:25.580
Pregnant?

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:29.240
Cross! So...!

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:33.620
I see.
Ben's puppies...

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:37.260
Benizakura!

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:41.630
As long as you don't accept me as
a male, I can't back out!

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:45.720
I am the one.. I am the one...

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:49.390
As a male, Ben entrusted me the leadership.

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:51.640
Silver!

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:55.020
Quit it, Cross.
I was prepared for this.

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:59.400
I am happy to throw my
little life away for our goal!

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:02.200
Silver!

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:03.860
Silver!

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:07.860
<i>He's really prepared to die...</i>

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:11.490
<i>So calm...</i>

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:14.750
<i>He is a real male.</i>

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:20.750
Don't underestimate me!

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:27.810
Im-Impossible!
I'm a big dog…!

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:29.720
K-kid, let go!

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:45.980
Silver, that's enough for you!

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:48.040
You will be killed if you
continue to fight!

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.040
Silver!

00:19:58.540 --> 00:19:59.790
Damn!

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:04.770
Stop! The fight is over!

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:07.300
Not yet! The fight is not over!

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:11.050
What are you talking about?
I don't even know what you mean!

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:12.550
Well, Benizakura?

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:14.100
I'm still alive.

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:18.060
It's been a while since I
was this excited.

00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:20.310
Apparently, it seems like
I misunderstood you.

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:21.810
W-What?

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:24.070
What do you mean, Benizakura?

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:27.570
I understand what's in your heart.

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:28.820
Th-Then you will...?

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:35.580
Then you, Benizakura, will...

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:40.580
Benizakura of Tosa's
remaining fraction of life...

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:43.580
Kid! I'll give it to you!

00:20:59.230 --> 00:20:59.850
Don!

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:01.850
Where are you going?

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:04.360
Don!

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:11.740
Don!

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:13.490
Don...

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:18.500
<i>Daisuke...</i>

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:42.940
Don!

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:16.330
Come on!

00:22:34.570 --> 00:22:40.450
<i>With Benizakura, the world's
strongest male, they were gathered.</i>

00:22:41.620 --> 00:22:44.200
<i>But they have to hurry to the north.</i>

00:22:44.960 --> 00:22:45.960
<i>Hurry, Silver!</i>

00:22:46.710 --> 00:22:48.210
<i>Hurry up, males!</i>

00:22:54.470 --> 00:23:00.520
To be continued...

00:23:14.680 --> 00:23:19.930
When a shower of a moonlight

00:23:20.900 --> 00:23:26.060
bathes you gently

00:23:27.160 --> 00:23:32.200
Say goodbye to pain and

00:23:34.040 --> 00:23:40.760
let it flow away

00:23:40.920 --> 00:23:46.760
For he who lives today with all his heart

00:23:47.060 --> 00:23:53.390
a better tomorrow will surely come

00:23:53.730 --> 00:23:59.570
TOMORROW, let us run again

00:24:00.400 --> 00:24:05.450
TOMORROW, lets shine brightly
